{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07317","headline":"赠元容州 · 刘长卿","name":"赠元容州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拥旌临合浦，上印卧长沙。\n海徼长无戍，湘山独种畲。\n政传通岁贡，才惜过年华。\n万里依孤劒，千峰寄一家。\n累徵期旦暮，未起恋烟霞。\n避世歌芝草，休官醉菊花。\n旧游如梦里，此别是天涯。\n何事沧波上，漂漂逐海槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07317.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07317","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}